sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Merchant as Merchant Site<br/>(Next.js)
    participant Stripe as Stripe<br/>(PaymentIntents + CPM)
    participant Adapter as CPM Adapter<br/>(Cloudflare Worker)
    participant Kinesis as Kinesis Pay<br/>(Merchant API)
    participant KMS as Kinesis App<br/>(customer wallet)

    Customer->>Merchant: Browse, click "Buy"
    Merchant->>Stripe: paymentIntents.create({ amount, currency })
    Stripe-->>Merchant: client_secret + pi_id
    Merchant->>Customer: Render Payment Element<br/>(Card + "Pay with Gold" via cpmt_)

    Customer->>Merchant: Selects "Pay with Gold", clicks Pay
    Note over Merchant: CPM detected client-side → skip Stripe confirmPayment
    Merchant->>Adapter: Redirect to /pay/:pi_id

    Adapter->>Stripe: paymentIntents.retrieve(pi_id)
    Stripe-->>Adapter: { amount, currency, status }
    Adapter->>Kinesis: createPayment({ amount, currency })
    Kinesis-->>Adapter: { paymentId, expiryAt, ... }
    Adapter->>Stripe: paymentIntents.update<br/>(bind metadata.kinesis_payment_id = kpId)
    Adapter->>Customer: Render QR encoding<br/>kms.kinesis.money?paymentId=…

    Customer->>KMS: Scans QR with phone
    KMS->>Customer: Show "Pay {merchant} 0.0X KAU"
    Customer->>KMS: Tap "Pay"
    KMS->>Kinesis: Customer approves
    Note over Kinesis: Funds move customer → merchant<br/>Status: created → processed

    loop Every 10s while on QR page
        Customer->>Adapter: GET /pay-status/:pi_id
        Adapter->>Stripe: paymentIntents.retrieve<br/>(metadata.kinesis_payment_id = kpId)
        Adapter->>Kinesis: getPaymentStatus(kpId)
        Kinesis-->>Adapter: { status: 'created' | 'processed' | ... }
    end

    Note over Adapter: Closeout on processed (idempotent)
    Adapter->>Kinesis: confirmPayment({ paymentId, orderId: pi_id })
    Adapter->>Stripe: paymentIntents.update<br/>(metadata.kinesis_status = processed)
    Adapter->>Stripe: paymentRecords.reportPayment<br/>(processor_details.custom.payment_reference = kpId)

    Adapter->>Customer: Redirect to merchant /success?payment_intent=…
    Customer->>Merchant: GET /success?payment_intent=…
    Merchant->>Stripe: paymentIntents.retrieve(pi_id)
    Stripe-->>Merchant: { metadata.kinesis_status: 'processed', ... }
    Merchant->>Customer: "Payment received via Kinesis Pay"
